==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology 1===
Presumed to be a modification of [[ч]] (''č''), itself a modification of the Glagolitic letter [[Ⱍ]]. The first recorded use in modern form is in the 15th century [[w:Romanian Cyrillic alphabet|Romanian Cyrillic alphabet]]. First used by Serbian scribes in the 17th century and part of [[w:Vuk Stefanović Karadžić|Vuk Stefanović Karadžić’s]] Cyrillic alphabet reform.

